    notes: "8086 Kural\u0131: AX, CX, DX veya SP k\xF6\u015Feli parantez i\xE7inde dolayl\u0131 adresleme i\xE7in KULLANILAMAZ! (MOV AX, [CX] ge\xE7ersizdir)."
