      <ul class="nb-list"><li>\xB5P</li><li>BMI3121 \xB7 MICROPROCESSOR SYSTEMS</li><li>Week 2</li><li>The Microprocessor and Its Architecture</li><li>The internal programming model: registers, the flags register, segment registers, and real-mode memory addressing.</li><li>Course content adapted from Brey, The Intel Microprocessors (2008), and supplementary course notes.</li></ul>
