      <ul class="nb-list"><li>01 / 05</li><li>The Programming Model</li><li>What is inside the microprocessor, and how the registers are organized</li><li>Week 2 \xB7 BMI3121 Microprocessor Systems</li><li>Section divider    3</li></ul>
