            "taskPrompt": "BX yazmac\u0131na 5678h y\xFCkleyin. Ard\u0131ndan MOV BL, 00h komutuyla sadece alt bayt\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlay\u0131n (BX = 5600h olmal\u0131d\u0131r).",
