            "starterCode": "; Stack Ad\u0131m 3: PUSH AX ve POP DX uygulamas\u0131\nORG 100h\nMOV SP, 0200h\n\n; AX = 5678h y\xFCkleyin, PUSH AX yap\u0131n ve POP DX ile DX i\xE7ine \xE7ekin:\n\n\nHLT\n",
