                <ul>
                  <li><strong>Bellekten Belle\u011Fe (<code>MOV mem, mem</code>):</strong> BIU tek bir makine \xE7evriminde sistem adres veriyoluna yaln\u0131zca tek bir adres s\xFCrebilir. Veri \xF6nce yazmaca okunmal\u0131 (<code>MOV AX, [KAYNAK]</code>) ard\u0131ndan hedefe yaz\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r (<code>MOV [HEDEF], AX</code>).</li>
                  <li><strong>Segment Yazmac\u0131na Anl\u0131k Sabit (<code>MOV SegReg, imm</code>):</strong> 8086 mikro-kod ROM'unda segment yazmac\u0131na immediate literal kabul eden op-code \u015Fablonu yoktur. De\u011Fer \xF6nce <code>AX</code>'e al\u0131n\u0131p oradan aktar\u0131l\u0131r.</li>
                  <li><strong>Segmentler Aras\u0131 Aktar\u0131m (<code>MOV SegReg, SegReg</code>):</strong> \u0130ki segment yazmac\u0131 aras\u0131nda do\u011Frudan veri yolu hatt\u0131 yoktur. Genel yazma\xE7 veya y\u0131\u011F\u0131n (<code>PUSH DS / POP ES</code>) \xFCzerinden aktar\u0131l\u0131r.</li>
                  <li><strong>CS Yazmac\u0131na Yazma (<code>MOV CS, reg/mem</code>):</strong> CS rastgele de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilirse IP derhal ge\xE7ersiz komut alan\u0131na d\xFC\u015Fer ve i\u015Flemci kilitlenir! CS yaln\u0131zca kontroll\xFC <code>JMP FAR, CALL FAR, RET FAR</code> veya <code>INT/IRET</code> ile g\xFCncellenebilir.</li>
                </ul>
