  <p class="nb-p">Ana klas\xF6rdeki <code>Week 6 - Program Control Instructions.pdf</code> dosyas\u0131n\u0131n <strong>Slayt 11\u201320</strong> aral\u0131\u011F\u0131ndaki t\xFCm slayt ba\u015Fl\u0131klar\u0131, tablolar\u0131, \xF6rnekleri ve c\xFCmleleri a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da <strong>slayt s\u0131ras\u0131yla (1'den 40'a eksiksiz)</strong> yer almaktad\u0131r:</p>
