      "titleEn": "Sections 04/05 \u2013 05/05 (Slides 21\u201340): Procedures (PROC/ENDP, CALL/RET, SUMS), Interrupts (INT, IVT, Vector 21H) & Putting It Together",
      "summary": "Slayt 21\u201340: Prosed\xFCr tan\u0131m\u0131, CALL ve RET y\u0131\u011F\u0131n mekani\u011Fi, SUMS prosed\xFCr\xFC, i\xE7 i\xE7e CALL y\u0131\u011F\u0131n tahmini, Donan\u0131m vs Yaz\u0131l\u0131m kesmeleri, IVT (00000H\u2013003FFH), INT 21H vekt\xF6r hesab\u0131 (00084H) ve yayg\u0131n hatalar.",
