            "taskPrompt": "AX = 4567h de\u011Ferini PUSH AX ile y\u0131\u011F\u0131na at\u0131n. Ard\u0131ndan MOV CL, [01FEh] ve MOV CH, [01FFh] ile y\u0131\u011F\u0131ndaki baytlar\u0131 okuyun.",
