        "taskPrompt": "AL yazmac\u0131na 0FEh y\xFCkleyin. CBW komutunu \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n. AX yazmac\u0131n\u0131n 0xFFFE oldu\u011Funu do\u011Frulay\u0131n ve program\u0131 HLT ile sonland\u0131r\u0131n.",
        "starterCode": "; 6.3 CBW ile \u0130\u015Faret Geni\u015Fletme\nORG 100h\n\nMOV AL, 0FEh    ; -2 (8-bit)\n\n; CBW komutunu \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n:\n\n\nHLT\n",
