        "taskPrompt": "CLD \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n. CX = 4, AL = 0AAh, DI = 0200h yap\u0131n. REP STOSB komutunu \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n. Sonu\xE7ta CX = 0 ve DI = 0204h oldu\u011Funu do\u011Frulay\u0131n.",
        "starterCode": "; 7.2 REP STOSB ile Blok Doldurma\nORG 100h\n\n; CLD ile ileri y\xF6n\xFC se\xE7in:\n; CX = 4, AL = 0AAh, DI = 0200h ayarlay\u0131n:\n; REP STOSB komutunu \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n:\n\n\nHLT\n",
