                  <li><strong>Nipel Takas\u0131 (Nibble Swap):</strong> 8-bitlik bir yazma\xE7 4 kez d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCld\xFC\u011F\xFCnde y\xFCksek ve al\xE7ak 4 bit takas edilir: <code>ROL AL, 4</code> (\xD6rn: <code>F0h &rarr; 0Fh</code>).</li>
