        "taskPrompt": "AX=8 y\xFCkleyin, AL'ye 7 ekleyin ve AAA komutunu \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rarak AX=0105h olmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flay\u0131n.",
