            <p>Real Mode belle\u011Fin en ba\u015F\u0131nda (<code>00000h - 003FFh</code> aras\u0131, tam 1024 bayt = 1 KB) <strong>256 adet kesme vekt\xF6r\xFC</strong> bulunur. Her vekt\xF6r, ilgili ISR'nin 32-bitlik uzak adresini (<strong>Far Pointer: CS:IP</strong>) saklar:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>2 Bayt: Ofset Adresi (<code>IP</code>) \u2014 D\xFC\u015F\xFCk bayt \xF6nce (Little-Endian).</li>
