      "titleEn": "I/O Transfer Techniques: Programmed I/O (Polling) and Handshaking",
      "summary": "Me\u015Fgul bekleme (Busy-wait), Kesmeli G/\xC7 ve donan\u0131msal el s\u0131k\u0131\u015Fma sinyalleri (STB#, IBF, ACK#, OBF#) ile seri aray\xFCzler.",
