                <p class="study-brand-subtitle">${this.currentLang === "en" ? "Step-by-Step Curriculum, Interactive Notebook, and Practical Tasks" : "Ad\u0131m Ad\u0131m M\xFCfredat, \u0130nteraktif Not Defteri ve Pratik G\xF6revler"}</p>
